{"3277520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Berserker's Domain", "steam_appid": 3277520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/5110ce462895aae7f6f2b4a418b0179f.poster.avif?t=1758530488\" width=616 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/5110ce462895aae7f6f2b4a418b0179f.webm?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/5110ce462895aae7f6f2b4a418b0179f.mp4?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BERSERKER'S DOMAIN</strong> is a fast-paced, unhinged retro FPS freakshow with a roguelike loop, inspired by classics like <i>Blood</i>, <i>Quake 1-3</i>, and <i>Doom</i>, as well as modern shooters like <i>Dusk</i>, <i>ULTRAKILL</i>, and <i>Doom Eternal</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve died — only to be unleashed into an afterlife full of <strong>ultraviolence</strong>, <strong>explosions</strong>, <strong>gibs</strong>, <strong>fun</strong>, and <strong>fresh</strong> <strong>victims</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/9e590810d01bf46a9a3ab8b990600749.poster.avif?t=1758530488\" width=616 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/9e590810d01bf46a9a3ab8b990600749.webm?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/9e590810d01bf46a9a3ab8b990600749.mp4?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, dash, and double-jump around the battlefield at <strong>break-neck speed</strong>, tearing through swarms of cultists, demons, monsters, soldiers, sorcerers, and demigods. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a brutal arsenal of <strong>nasty-ass weapons</strong>, each with a bunch of <strong>nonsense upgrades</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock ultimate &quot;synergy upgrades&quot; that combine bonuses from different weapons. Want a Dynamite that explodes into shotgun pellets? Sure, why not.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/aa6e10302441a835085b65e04f57ac99.poster.avif?t=1758530488\" width=616 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/aa6e10302441a835085b65e04f57ac99.webm?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/aa6e10302441a835085b65e04f57ac99.mp4?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the <strong>Play</strong> button and you're shooting stuff in 5 seconds.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No menus, no waiting for load screens, no tutorials. Just run the game and have fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each death starts a new, <strong>randomized run</strong> with fresh maps, weapons, upgrades, and enemies. No two runs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run. Hunt. RAMPAGE</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/5110ce462895aae7f6f2b4a418b0179f.poster.avif?t=1758530488\" width=616 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/5110ce462895aae7f6f2b4a418b0179f.webm?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/5110ce462895aae7f6f2b4a418b0179f.mp4?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BERSERKER'S DOMAIN</strong> is a fast-paced, unhinged retro FPS freakshow with a roguelike loop, inspired by classics like <i>Blood</i>, <i>Quake 1-3</i>, and <i>Doom</i>, as well as modern shooters like <i>Dusk</i>, <i>ULTRAKILL</i>, and <i>Doom Eternal</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve died — only to be unleashed into an afterlife full of <strong>ultraviolence</strong>, <strong>explosions</strong>, <strong>gibs</strong>, <strong>fun</strong>, and <strong>fresh</strong> <strong>victims</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/9e590810d01bf46a9a3ab8b990600749.poster.avif?t=1758530488\" width=616 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/9e590810d01bf46a9a3ab8b990600749.webm?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/9e590810d01bf46a9a3ab8b990600749.mp4?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, dash, and double-jump around the battlefield at <strong>break-neck speed</strong>, tearing through swarms of cultists, demons, monsters, soldiers, sorcerers, and demigods. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a brutal arsenal of <strong>nasty-ass weapons</strong>, each with a bunch of <strong>nonsense upgrades</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock ultimate &quot;synergy upgrades&quot; that combine bonuses from different weapons. Want a Dynamite that explodes into shotgun pellets? Sure, why not.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/aa6e10302441a835085b65e04f57ac99.poster.avif?t=1758530488\" width=616 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/aa6e10302441a835085b65e04f57ac99.webm?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/aa6e10302441a835085b65e04f57ac99.mp4?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the <strong>Play</strong> button and you're shooting stuff in 5 seconds.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No menus, no waiting for load screens, no tutorials. Just run the game and have fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each death starts a new, <strong>randomized run</strong> with fresh maps, weapons, upgrades, and enemies. No two runs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run. Hunt. RAMPAGE</strong></p>", "short_description": "BERSERKER'S DOMAIN is a stupid, super fast little FPS with roguelike elements. Inspired by Quake, Doom, ULTRAKILL, and Blood. No load screens, tutorials or menus - just click Play and you're shooting stuff in 5 seconds. Quick play sessions and randomized runs for endless mindless fun.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“It’s really fun. The level design and flow kept me engaged, and the E1M1 easter egg made me smile. People are going to enjoy this.”<br>John Romero<br><br>“What a weird-ass game.”<br>Some guy on YouTube<br><br>“This game might be everything I've ever wanted in life -- a Minigun Raven. That explodes.”<br>ZlimBratSki<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/header.jpg?t=1758530488", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/f1fb5e07577b4f727e5ce34b577137b7d6f2a358/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758530488", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/f1fb5e07577b4f727e5ce34b577137b7d6f2a358/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758530488", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64bit or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9300H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 700 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> 🤷</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64bit or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-11400F / AMD Ryzen 5 5600X or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> 🤘</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREDITS</h2><br>Berserker's Domain uses some of the assets (textures and parts of map geometry) from <i>FreeDoom</i> project.<br>These assets are licensed under the following BSD license:<br><br>Copyright © 2001-2024 Contributors to the Freedoom project. All rights reserved.<br>Redistribution and use in source